### 第 15 阶段：先抢票生成订单
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/grab
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-demo-001

{
  "userId": 9800,
  "sessionId": 101,
  "ticketCategoryId": 1001
}

### 支付订单，把订单 id 换成上一步返回值
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/replace-with-order-id/pay
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-demo-002

### 按用户查询订单
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/users/9800/orders
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-demo-003

### 按订单查询电子票
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/orders/replace-with-order-id/ticket
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-demo-004

### 按票码查询电子票，把 ticketCode 换成支付接口返回值
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/tickets/replace-with-ticket-code
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-demo-005
